So if you have a blessed pen and a cursed scroll, you can write
a scroll of mail (which makes the scroll uncursed), #dip it, and
then write another scroll to get a blessed scroll; you'd have used
up a charge, which may be better than using up a potion of holy
water if it's scarce...

